# The task rail and the manifest's actions: Hint (H), a refused delivery with
# its reason, Esc clears the selection, the Sound toggle, Restart (R and the
# button), a refused merge (not touching) with its reason.
until 300 Play
frames 10
click Play
until 120 Restoration tasks
key KeyH 2
until 30 Hint: merge from row 1, column 2 to row 1, column 3.
click Mallet
until 30 Mallet selected
key KeyD 2
until 30 No task wants that tool right now.
# the refused tool stays selected; Esc lets it go
key Escape 2
until 30 Selection cleared.
# (a click while Esc is still held is not taken as one: let it go first)
frames 5
click Mallet
until 30 Mallet selected
click Twine
until 30 Tools only merge on touching cells.
click Sound: on
until 30 Sound off.
expect Sound: off
click Sound: off
until 30 Sound on.
click Hint
until 30 Hint: merge
click Restart
until 30 Merge two matching tools side by side
key KeyR 2
until 30 Merge two matching tools side by side
expect Moves0
